@startuml Sequence Diagram - Create Note
title Sequence diagram: Создание заметки из выделенного текста

actor User
participant "Content Script\n(content.js)" as Content
participant "Highlighter" as Highlighter
participant "AnchorManager" as Anchor
participant "Background Worker\n(background.js)" as Background
participant "IndexedDB\n(db.js)" as DB
participant "Note Card UI" as NoteCard

User -> Content: Двойной клик на текст
activate Content

Content -> Content: Получить выделение текста
Content -> Anchor: createAnchor(selection)
activate Anchor
Anchor -> Anchor: Извлечь текст и контекст
Anchor -> Anchor: Создать DOM path
Anchor --> Content: anchorData
deactivate Anchor

Content -> Background: saveAnchor(anchor)
activate Background
Background -> DB: saveAnchor(anchor)
activate DB
DB --> Background: saved anchor
deactivate DB
Background --> Content: anchor response
deactivate Background

Content -> Background: saveNote(note)
activate Background
Background -> DB: saveNote(note)
activate DB
DB --> Background: saved note
deactivate DB
Background --> Content: note response
deactivate Background

Content -> Highlighter: highlightText(range, noteId)
activate Highlighter
Highlighter -> Highlighter: Обернуть текст в span
Highlighter --> Content: highlight created
deactivate Highlighter

Content -> NoteCard: new NoteCard(noteId, noteData)
activate NoteCard
NoteCard -> NoteCard: Создать UI карточки
NoteCard --> User: Отобразить карточку
deactivate NoteCard

Content --> User: Заметка создана и отображена
deactivate Content

@enduml
